<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GPT sells Sydney building to Promet.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GPT sells Sydney building to Promet.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Property Trust (GPT) said on Tuesday it plans to sell a Sydney office building it jointly owns with Australian Prime Property Fund to an associate of Malaysian group Promet Bhd for A$43 million.</p>
<p>GPT said the purchaser, Galileo Hotel Development Fund, plans to develop the site, Wales House, 38 Hunter Street, Sydney into a hotel in time for the 2000 Olympics.</p>
<p>It said the sale is subject to a call option agreement exercisable before April 23, 1997 and a put option exercisable thereafter but before May 23, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
